{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/extras/64a432d55ac8c027f672c1ab5ca14665.avif?t=1774509787\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/extras_big/64a432d55ac8c027f672c1ab5ca14665.webp?t=1774509787 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your truck in this sci-fi driving adventure. Upgrade your truck, manage your resources, and chart your own path across quiet rural backroads. Scavenge materials, adapt to the unknown and uncover the secrets of a world quietly ruled by an artificial intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/extras/80b0f20b328ee8357c2c817164248803.poster.avif?t=1774509787\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/extras/80b0f20b328ee8357c2c817164248803.webm?t=1774509787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/extras/80b0f20b328ee8357c2c817164248803.mp4?t=1774509787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your truck and use it as more than just transport, demolish barriers, carry heavy loads, and solve puzzles that reshape the path ahead. Every tool you add changes how your machine looks and plays, turning it into the true protagonist of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/extras/dfa0b940ccdddc784763d6f08058e071.poster.avif?t=1774509787\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/extras/dfa0b940ccdddc784763d6f08058e071.webm?t=1774509787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/extras/dfa0b940ccdddc784763d6f08058e071.mp4?t=1774509787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the environment using all your tools, cross difficult terrain, explore uncharted territory and explore a world dominated by The Machine. It watches, guides, and interferes. Learn its behavior, bend it to your advantage, and decide how much control you\u2019re willing to surrender.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/extras/e4331f8623a39e86ad3dae6339782cb8.poster.avif?t=1774509787\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/extras/e4331f8623a39e86ad3dae6339782cb8.webm?t=1774509787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/extras/e4331f8623a39e86ad3dae6339782cb8.mp4?t=1774509787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore handcrafted landscapes where spanish rural beauty collides with sci-fi brutalist structures. Discover hidden details through light, perspective, and silence. Manage your cargo in a dynamic storage system that makes every resource a puzzle under pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, upgrade and customize your truck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore rural landscapes with brutalist sci-fi structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources on your truck bed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets and new routes in a condensed open world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/extras/4ada75b0efeb57e4fb6c8d9db700e2fc.poster.avif?t=1774509787\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/extras/4ada75b0efeb57e4fb6c8d9db700e2fc.webm?t=1774509787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/extras/4ada75b0efeb57e4fb6c8d9db700e2fc.mp4?t=1774509787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005880?t=1774509787","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005880?t=1774509787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/a7a9dccf0cbd13eb209369b65b923ea64b7ac7d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774509787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/a7a9dccf0cbd13eb209369b65b923ea64b7ac7d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774509787","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/extras/64a432d55ac8c027f672c1ab5ca14665.avif?t=1774509787\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005880/extras_big/64a432d55ac8c027f672c1ab5ca14665.webp?t=1774509787 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p clas